  newsletterSubscribed Boolean @default(true)

  /// True for system-owned users like `wishonia` that author OUTBOUND_MESSAGE
  /// and SYSTEM_NOTE TaskComment rows. Filter out of normal user listings,
  /// leaderboards, referral attribution, and human accountability views.
  isSystem Boolean @default(false)

  /// First URL the user landed on, captured ONCE at first signin from the
  /// client (via localStorage, populated on first page load). Preserves
  /// query params (`?ref=alice`, `?utm_source=tweet`, `?campaign=...`)
  /// AND the host (which encodes the site variant), so we don't need a
  /// separate `signupSiteKey` column — derive the variant by passing the
  /// URL's host to `getSiteFromHost` whenever we need it. If indexed
  /// per-variant queries become hot later, add a Postgres generated
  /// column or a partial index then. Null for users created before this
  /// column was added or when the client didn't capture it (some browsers
